1
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:06,000
Little Dixie is a action, crime, thriller film directed by John Swab.

2
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:06,000
Erstwhile Special Forces operative Doc Alexander is asked to broker
a truce with the Mexican drug cartel in secrecy.

3
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
When Oklahoma Governor Richard Jeffs celebrates the execution of a high-ranking cartel member
on TV, his Chief of Staff and Doc inform him about the peace he just ended.

4
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:06,000
But it’s too late, as Cuco, the cartel’s hatchet man, has set
his vengeful sights on Doc’s daughter Dixie.

5
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Doc Alexander, played by Frank Grillo.

6
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Governor Richard Jeffs, played by Eric Dane.

7
00:49:00,000 --> 00:49:06,000
Billie Riggs, played by Annabeth Gish.

8
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
Julie Reed, played by Mercedes Mason.

9
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Karl Roach, played by Peter Greene.

10
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
Raphael 'Cuco' Prado, played by Beau Knapp.

11
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Little Dixie is a 2023 American crime thriller film
written and directed by John Swab.

12
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
It stars Frank Grillo, Eric Dane, Beau Knapp, Annabeth Gish, Peter
Greene, Thomas Dekker, Mercedes Mason, and Maurice Compte.

13
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
The film premiered at the 2023 International Film Festival Rotterdam, and was released in select
theaters and video on demand in the United States on February 3, 2023, by Paramount Pictures.

14
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:06,000
The tone is emotional and intense.
